OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein calls on Taoiseach to
OL,4,Ameet residents over Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein MLA John O'Dowd has asked the
OL,7,FTaoiseach Micheal Martin to visit the
OL,8,FGarvaghy Road and speak to residents
OL,9,Fabout the Drumcree dispute.
OL,11,FO'Dowd said he was concerned there had
OL,12,Fbeen no visible engagement from the
OL,13,FIrish Government on the issue.
OL,15,FThe earliest date for a decision by the
OL,16,FParades Commission on the planned
OL,17,FDrumcree march by Portadown Orange
OL,18,FOrder is 23 September ` four days
OL,19,Fbefore the scheduled parade.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
